  shortComment: "What is this interruption?\r"
  diaryEntry: It appears I have been forced to halt upon the way to dinner in the
    nearby town. Mr. Kalahan, my coachman, has inexplicably deserted the carriage.
    Whether this is meant as some ill-considered ruse, I cannot yet tell.
  alreadyReadComment: I've already looked at this.
  sequenceManager: {fileID: 1940110987}
